    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37862" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">prae-pōto</span></b> , āre,
			v. n. and <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>a.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Neutr.</i>, <i>to drink before</i>
			(post-class.), <i><span class="en">Cael. Aur. Acut. 3, 17,
			159</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Act.</i>, <i>to give to drink</i> or
				<i>make drink of before</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">praepotat absinthio aegrotantes vino sincero,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cael.
						Aur. Acut. 3, 17, 160</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">id. Tard. 5, 10, 120</span></i>.</div>
